  "description": "*“I’m the real Edith Abina?!”*\n\nTrapped in a reverse harem game. Even becoming a villain who has killed countless times! The protagonist, a player in the virtual reality game, “Experience! The Scene of Life: Saint Edition,” wakes up in the body of the villainess “Edith Abina,” not the game’s protagonist, the saint “Gian.” But no matter what I do, I can’t log out-?! On top of that, in order to figure out a way to return to reality, I have to beep-- beep- with 5 other characters to find true love?\n\n*“What the heck~~~!”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
